# Apple (macOS/iOS/tvOS/Catalyst/visionOS) patch series for ffmpeg.
# One pool filename per line; order is authoritative and nothing is sorted.
# Shared with the android series: the libdovi profile 7 to 8.1 conversion
# helper the MediaCodec and the VideoToolbox path both call. First, so its
# Makefile lines land on the pristine file before any later patch reads them.
0021-dolby-vision-convert-profile7-rpu-to-p81.patch
0001-fix-visionos-videotoolbox.patch
0002-videotoolbox-add-dolby-vision-hevc-format.patch
0003-videotoolbox-convert-dolby-vision-p7.patch
0004-videotoolbox-preserve-dolby-vision-attachments.patch
0005-libavutil-videotoolbox-share-the-attachment-copy.patch
0005-videotoolbox-tag-dolby-vision-hdr.patch
0008-videotoolbox-set-sample-size.patch
0009-videotoolbox-forward-dolby-vision-rpus.patch
0010-hevc-downlevel-duplicate-dovi-rpu-log.patch
0011-securetransport-disable-pem-import-for-catalyst.patch
0013-videotoolbox-never-signal-dolby-vision-metadata-compression.patch
0014-videotoolbox-fall-back-to-plain-hevc-session.patch
0015-hevc-downlevel-skipped-nal-log.patch
